{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Internal shared patch-journal implementation. Patch history is INSTANCE-LOCAL: it lives in the gitignored runtime library as one index record (id DERIVED as dev_journal_<lib>_<ctlid> - nothing is ever written to a tracked record) plus one record per patch. A control with no runtime journal reads its legacy <ctlid>_patches record. ops: read / status (never write); append (first write imports the legacy history into runtime, verified entry by entry, and LEAVES the legacy record alone; never fails on journal state - an unusable index is set aside and a warning returned); migrate (explicit: import, carry over any entries an older binary appended to the legacy record since, then delete the legacy record via app.delete; dry_run reports only); move (re-keys the journal to to_lib after the control has moved and appends the entry); delete. Returns FLAT {status, storage runtime|legacy|none, patches, total, legacy_present, warning...}. Journal writes are serialized per process only. Callers should normally use list_control_patches or convert_patch_journals.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::time::time;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::unique_session_id::unique_session_id;\nuse ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse std::sync::{Mutex, MutexGuard, OnceLock};","params":[{"desc":"read, status, append, migrate, move, or delete","name":"op","type":"String"},{"desc":"Source library owning the control","name":"lib","type":"String"},{"desc":"Source control name or record id","name":"ctl","type":"String"},{"desc":"Target library for move; empty otherwise","name":"to_lib","type":"String"},{"desc":"Patch fields for append/move; empty object otherwise","name":"entry","type":"JSONObject"},{"desc":"Maximum newest-first patches for read; 0 returns all","name":"limit","type":"Integer"},{"desc":"For migrate: report without writing or deleting","name":"dry_run","type":"Boolean"},{"desc":"Calling session; used to authorize legacy/runtime record deletion","name":"nn_sessionid","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"klvnjy1a1c17d9880h47","readers":[],"time":1794318026175,"username":"system","writers":[]}